  "description": "Could love bedazzle like a gem?\n\nFor Melisa, the best gemologist in Annabel, no love can outshine a gem. She'd rather remain single and devoted to her career! But just when she thinks she has it all figured out, Duke Lewis Winterfelt, the most eligible bachelor in all the kingdom, asks for her hand in marriage — through a contract! \n\n(Source: Manta)",
